# This project parses HTTP, and HTTP line endings are CRLF by specification.
# Git's autocrlf normalisation rewriting line endings inside a test fixture would
# silently corrupt the exact bytes the parser is being tested against, so pin LF in the
# working tree everywhere and keep every CRLF in the protocol an explicit \r\n in source.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
